   "displayName": "Scalable court size and 60 paddle skins included for no extra cost",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-16T23:56:47.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Scalable Court Sizes — Train Anywhere",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re excited to introduce a major update that gives you complete freedom over your training environment. Our new Scalable Court feature lets you adjust the court size to match your real‑world space, so you can practice wherever you are.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What’s new",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Adjust the court size with a simple slider to fit your available space",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Train in your room, garage, or backyard without losing precision",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Switch between court sizes instantly to simulate different match scenarios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Consistent physics and realism at every scale",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Whether you have a full court or just a few meters to work with, the game now adapts to you. Train in your room. Train outside. Train anywhere.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Update now and take your skills to the next level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
